{"model":"qwen3.6:35b","variant":"hosted;outline;prompt=solver-v2.9;max=28000","text":"{\n  \"answers\": [\n    {\n      \"answer\": \"ĐPCM\",\n      \"part\": \"a\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"outline\": \"Phương trình luôn có $\\u0394' = m^2+1 > 0 \\u21d2$ có 2 nghiệm $x_1, x_2$.\\n\\u00c1p dụng Vi-\\u00eat: $x_1+x_2 = 2(m+1)$, $x_1x_2 = 2m$.\\n\\u0110ặt $P = (x_1+\\u221a(x_1^2+1))(x_2+\\u221a(x_2^2+1))$.\\nNh\\u1eadn x\\u00e9t $\\u221a(x^2+1)-x = \\frac{1}{x+\\u221a(x^2+1)} \\u21d2 \\frac{1}{P} = (\\u221a(x_1^2+1)-x_1)(\\u221a(x_2^2+1)-x_2)$.\\nT\\u00ednh $P+\\frac{1}{P} = 2(\\u221a((x_1^2+1)(x_2^2+1)) + x_1x_2)$.\\n$P=1 \\u21d4 P+\\frac{1}{P}=2 \\u21d4 \\u221a((x_1^2+1)(x_2^2+1)) = 1-x_1x_2$.\\nB\\u00ecnh ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng: $(x_1^2+1)(x_2^2+1) = (1-x_1x_2)^2 \\u21d4 (x_1+x_2)^2 = 0$.\\n$\\u21d4 x_1+x_2=0 \\u21d4 2(m+1)=0 \\u21d4 m=-1$.\\nChi\\u1ec1u thu\\u1eadn: $m=-1 \\u21d2 x_2=-x_1 \\u21d2 P = (\\u221a(x_1^2+1))^2 - x_1^2 = 1$.\\nK\\u1ebft lu\\u1eadn: \\u0110PCM.\"\n}","usage":{"input":230,"cachedInput":0,"output":5763,"reasoning":3434},"latencyMs":45355,"createdAt":"2026-10-09T15:19:11.960Z"}